text = "Ah, math—everyone loves it. Even the safe loves doing math.
It’s so passionate about it that it’s delved into the most advanced mathematical concepts in the field. It’s even created its own way of calculating!
It’s included its creation in the unencrypted secret code, so I have to explain its… thing… with concrete examples… of its… weird stuff."
autowrap_mode = 3

